            "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The original VR-ONLY ghost-busting, roguelike.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tested on: Vive, Rift, and Quest 2 (Link). Not tested/unsupported on newer headsets.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something paranormal is sweeping through the town of Weirdwood. Dust off your gear and climb an ever-changing haunted tower. Capture phantoms, search for hidden totems, and discover powerful items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Designed from the ground up for hand presence, room-scale dodging, and VR comfort.</strong></p>",
            "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The original VR-ONLY ghost-busting, roguelike.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tested on: Vive, Rift, and Quest 2 (Link). Not tested/unsupported on newer headsets.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something paranormal is sweeping through the town of Weirdwood. Dust off your gear and climb an ever-changing haunted tower. Capture phantoms, search for hidden totems, and discover powerful items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Designed from the ground up for hand presence, room-scale dodging, and VR comfort.</strong></p>",
